                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "Shown when the revision declares a yield and no servings. Baumy Biltong makes 4.5 kg dried and never claims a number of people, so a stepper here would count something the recipe does not measure. The field is type=\"text\" with inputMode=\"decimal\": a number input empties itself in Chrome part-way through an entry (R-SCR-35). Range 0.1 to 100.",
