                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "By a 2px rule, a mono kind label and an icon — never by a filled box. Only warning takes a wash of colour, because only warning has to interrupt. Science leaves the set entirely and gets its own panel and its own construction (R-SCR-11). Seven quiet kinds, one loud one.",
