                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "Repeat. They answer different questions: the checklist is “what do I buy and what do I already have”, the chips are “what do I reach for at this step”. Both scale from the one control. On a phone they sit in different tabs, which is right — the cook is doing a different thing in each.",
