                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "N2IYA6",
                          "name": "Rule note",
                          "fill": "$text-faint",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 980,
                          "content": "R-SCR-19 — two amounts add together only when one unit converts into the other. Red wine vinegar is 45.2 g plus 2 oz, so it becomes 101.9 g. Garlic is 2 cloves plus 10 heads, which do not convert, so both are carried. R-SCR-20 — an amount with no quantity shows “some”.",
