                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Pack the sliced jalapeños and garlic into clean glass jars, pour the hot brine over so they are completely covered, and let the jars cool to room temperature. Seal and refrigerate at least 24 hours before eating so the flavours develop.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.7,
