                          "content": "Two amounts add together only when one unit converts into the other. Red wine vinegar is 45.2 g plus 2 oz, so it becomes 101.9 g. Garlic is 2 cloves plus 10 heads, which do not convert, so both are carried. An amount with no quantity shows “some”.",
