              "fill": "$d-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "An aircraft maintenance manual for food. The functional specification is written in ASD-STE100 — the controlled English the aerospace industry created in 1986 for maintenance documentation — so the reference was already named in the brief. This direction takes the rest of the apparatus with it.",
