                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "A maintenance manual has exactly three severity levels and never more. WARNING means a person can be hurt. CAUTION means the work can be spoiled. NOTE is information. Ranking the eight kinds by consequence instead of by category means six of them carry no colour at all, so the page cannot become a colour chart (Q-06).",
