                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "F6Bi53",
                          "name": "Decisions",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "gap": 52,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "F5NSw",
                              "name": "THE ARCHETYPE SAYS SPARSE. THE BRIEF SAYS DENSE.",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "layout": "vertical",
                              "gap": 12,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "EYz9q",
                                  "name": "H",
                                  "fill": "$e-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "THE ARCHETYPE SAYS SPARSE. THE BRIEF SAYS DENSE.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "$e-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 1.1
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "FQG8N",
                                  "name": "T",
                                  "fill": "$e-ink-2",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Both are right, and a catalogue raisonné is already both. A full-page plate faces a page of eight-point apparatus. Direction E keeps that structure exactly: monumental openers and generous plates, then the scholarly apparatus set small and tight. The two-speed hierarchy the archetype demands is the same two speeds the book has always had.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                                  "fontFamily": "$e-body",
                                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "d7bDI0",
                              "name": "THE ARCHETYPE SAYS MONOCHROME. R-TON-03 SAYS COLOUR MUST CLASSIFY.",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "layout": "vertical",
                              "gap": 12,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "xIA78",
                                  "name": "H",
                                  "fill": "$e-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "THE ARCHETYPE SAYS MONOCHROME. R-TON-03 SAYS COLOUR MUST CLASSIFY.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "$e-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 1.1
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "nlg7n",
                                  "name": "T",
                                  "fill": "$e-ink-2",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "In a monochrome catalogue, classification is carried by typographic form: mono small caps for apparatus labels, italic for the object named, roman for prose. One ink is admitted — vermilion — and only for the warning register and the current state. Auction catalogues have set lot numbers in red for a century; this is the same single concession, and nothing else takes colour.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                                  "fontFamily": "$e-body",
                                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "Jzk7E",
                              "name": "THE ARCHETYPE SAYS NO RULES ANYWHERE.",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "layout": "vertical",
                              "gap": 12,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "ypO7t",
                                  "name": "H",
                                  "fill": "$e-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "THE ARCHETYPE SAYS NO RULES ANYWHERE.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "$e-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 1.1
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "pkWNs",
                                  "name": "T",
                                  "fill": "$e-ink-2",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Honoured everywhere except the twelve-column measurement table, where R-STA-08 needs a scrollable grid a reader can track across. That table is the one place a hairline appears in this direction, and it is marked as such.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                                  "fontFamily": "$e-body",
                                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "l1MSM",
                          "name": "Also",
                          "fill": "$e-ink-3",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 1000,
                          "content": "Secondary references: Sotheby’s and Christie’s catalogue apparatus for the provenance chain and the condition report; Irma Boom for type that exceeds its page; the Rembrandt literature (White & Boon) for the convention of naming states by ordinal — first state, second state, and so on — which this direction adopts in place of “revision 6”.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                          "fontFamily": "$e-body",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "F1nS0z",
          "name": "II. COMPONENT LIBRARY",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 40,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wz2bA",
              "name": "Label",
              "fill": "#C6BEB1",
              "content": "II. COMPONENT LIBRARY",
              "fontFamily": "$e-head",
              "fontSize": 52,
              "letterSpacing": -0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "B1Kvg",
              "name": "Screens",
              "gap": 120,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "d6hSm",
                  "name": "Plate II — Component library",
                  "width": 1500,
                  "fill": "$e-paper",
                  "layout": "vertical",
