                                      "content": "The wash increased by thirty per cent and the seasoning by forty, both taken from what batch five ran short of. Salt was deliberately held flat at 13.85 g/kg against that reading: salt dissolves, so it does not need a volume bump for coverage, and over-salting is the one error here that cannot be corrected."
