                          "content": "Monumental Editorial is a light archetype and NN-FS-001 asks for dark first. This direction inverts without argument because it has no gradients, no elevation and no rules — it is paper, ink and one vermilion. Every value below was re-measured against the new ground rather than flipped; the red had to lighten to stay legible, and nothing else moved.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.75,
                          "fontFamily": "$e-body",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
